msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Argh! Thanks to you dragging your＿feet, we're going to be late.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Agh! Por culpa de tu lentitud,＿vamos a llegar tarde.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Which one of us was glued to the TV?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Quién estaba pegado a la tele?」"

msgid "Taiga「Whatever, let's go. We'll have to hurry＿if we want to get there before＿midnight!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como sea, vámonos. ¡Hay que＿darnos prisa si queremos llegar＿antes de medianoche!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, don't run! It's your fault if you fall.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No corras! Si caes, será culpa tuya.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ack!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Ay!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I told you so......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te lo dije......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There's a ton of people here......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hay un montón de gente aquí......」"

msgid "Taiga「And a ton of food stalls!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Y un montón de puestos de comida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, are you already hungry again?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, ¿ya tienes hambre otra vez?」"

msgid "Taiga「I have a little room for yakisoba. And＿takoyaki. And crepes......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tengo un huequito para yakisoba.＿Y takoyaki. Y crepes......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Exactly how big is your stomach?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De qué tamaño es tu estómago?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, shut up. I have a separate stomach＿for special occasions. Look, let's get＿takoyaki first!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ay, cállate. Tengo otro estómago＿para ocasiones especiales. Mira,＿¡compremos takoyaki primero!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, what next?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, ¿qué sigue?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Calm down a little. The sauce is＿dripping on your clothes.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cálmate un poco. Te está goteando＿salsa en la ropa.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's fine! So what's next? Something＿sweet? Crepes? Candy apples? Mmm,＿and you can't forget imagawayaki!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No importa! ¿Qué sigue? ¿Algo dulce?＿¿Crepes? ¿Manzanas acarameladas? Mmm,＿¡y no puede faltar el imagawayaki!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, this isn't just a festival. We came＿here to celebrate Hatsumode.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, esto no es solo un festival.＿Vinimos aquí a celebrar el Hatsumode.」"

msgid "Taiga「Same thing. I wish Yacchan was here＿with us.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es lo mismo. Ojalá Yacchan estuviera＿aquí con nosotros.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, Yasuko's still at work, huh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, Yasuko sigue trabajando, eh......」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, baked potatoes! Let's get some.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Oh, papas asadas! Vamos a comprar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She's not listening...... Weren't we＿getting dessert?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me escucha...... ¿No íbamos＿a comprar un postre?」"

msgid "Taiga「Get the phrase \"once in a lifetime＿opportunity\" in that brain. Hey mister!＿One pie...... I mean, one please!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Métete la frase \"oportunidad única en la＿vida\" en ese cerebro. ¡Oiga, señor! Una＿tarta...... ¡digo, una por favor!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Good grief.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Cielos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Whew......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Uf......」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup, that hit the spot!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Sí, eso me cayó de maravilla!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You and your damn \"see-food\" diet......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tu maldita dieta de \"ver y comer\"......」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, my stomach hurts a little.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, me duele un poco el estómago.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Of course it would.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cómo no te va a doler.」"

msgid "Patron「Hey guys, the New Year is only a＿minute away!」"
msgstr "Visitante「¡Oigan, falta solo un minuto＿para el Año Nuevo!」"

msgid "Patron「Let's do a countdown!」"
msgstr "Visitante「¡Hagamos la cuenta regresiva!」"

msgid "Taiga「Hear that, Ryuuji? One minute left.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Oíste eso, Ryuuji? Falta un minuto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it's true. It's already 11:59.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, es verdad. Ya son las 11:59.」"

msgid "Taiga「Why didn't you tell me you had a＿watch? I was about to miss the big＿moment.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué no me dijiste que tenías reloj?＿Casi me pierdo el gran momento.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You wouldn't miss it with everyone＿cheering.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te lo perderías con todo＿el mundo festejando.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's just retarded. How many＿seconds left?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso es una estupidez. ¿Cuántos＿segundos faltan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's see...... 30 seconds.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A ver...... 30 segundos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey, Ryuuji......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, Ryuuji......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm?」"

msgid "Taiga「Are you happy to be spending New＿Year's with someone like me?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Te alegra pasar el Año Nuevo＿con alguien como yo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now you ask me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ahora me lo preguntas?」"

msgid "Taiga「As long as you're okay with it......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mientras a ti te parezca bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......15 seconds left.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Faltan 15 segundos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Really?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「10, 9, 8, 7, 6......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「10, 9, 8, 7, 6......」"

msgid "Both「5, 4, 3, 2, 1......」"
msgstr "Ambos「5, 4, 3, 2, 1......」"

msgid "Taiga「Ooh, fireworks?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oh, ¿fuegos artificiales?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Can you see them?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Puedes verlos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nope...... I wonder where they're coming＿from.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No...... Me pregunto de dónde salen.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah......」"

msgid "Taiga「Happy New Year, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Feliz Año Nuevo, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... Happy New Year, Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Feliz Año Nuevo, Taiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「This line is so SLOW～!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Esta fila avanza muy LENTO～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's almost our turn, so hang in there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya casi nos toca, así que aguanta.」"

msgid "Taiga「But we'll be in this line for another half＿an hour - and it's freezing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero seguiremos en esta fila otra media＿hora, ¡y hace un frío horrible!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It is Hatsumode, after all. At the＿busiest shrines you'd have to wait 3 or＿4 hours.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es el Hatsumode, después de todo.＿En los santuarios más concurridos＿hay que esperar 3 o 4 horas.」"

msgid "Taiga「ARGH! It's taking forever because of all＿the greedy people!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡AGH! ¡Tarda una eternidad por culpa＿de toda la gente codiciosa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Greedy people?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Gente codiciosa?」"

msgid "Taiga「You know, the kinda people who make＿an offering of a mere ¥5, and then＿make a ton of wishes!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya sabes, el tipo de gente que da＿una ofrenda de apenas ¥5, ¡y luego＿pide un montón de deseos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Maybe she's talking about me. I＿can't remember too well.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tal vez habla de mí. No＿puedo recordarlo muy bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ugh. I'd hate to be next to such a＿senseless person.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Agh. Odiaría estar junto a una＿persona tan insensata.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't say that. I'm only going to make＿one wish.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No digas eso. Solo voy a pedir un deseo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Be generous with your offering, too.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sé generoso con tu ofrenda también.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? What's wrong with ¥5?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Qué tiene de malo dar ¥5?」"

msgid "Taiga「If you're asking for your memories＿back, don't be stingy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si vas a pedir recuperar tus＿recuerdos, no seas tacaño.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, the amount doesn't really matter＿here, you know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, la cantidad aquí no＿importa tanto, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Taiga「Whoa～ Maybe you should ask for them＿to fix that super-stingy attitude of＿yours instead?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vaya～ ¿Mejor no pides que te arreglen＿esa actitud tan tacaña tuya?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Listen here......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Escucha......」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey, it's our turn. Put in at least ¥50.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, es nuestro turno. Pon al menos ¥50.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I wish for my memories to return...... I＿even put in ¥100, so please help＿me......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Deseo que vuelvan mis recuerdos......＿Hasta puse ¥100, así que por favor＿ayúdame......）」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Well, Taiga's sure taking a while......＿Just a little more......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Vaya, Taiga sí que tarda......＿Un poco más......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Gah! Hey......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ah! Oye......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Huh?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Eh?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What the? Taiga, where'd you go?＿TAIGA?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Pero qué? Taiga, ¿adónde＿fuiste? ¿TAIGA?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Is she seriously...... in this huge crowd!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿En serio...... entre tanta gente?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「TAIGAAA! HEEEY!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡TAIGAAA! ¡OOOYE!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（She's gone...... Where the hell did she＿run off to!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Se fue...... ¡¿Adónde diablos＿se habrá metido?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（She's not here...... Fuck! I left my cell＿phone at home!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No está aquí...... ¡Maldición!＿¡Dejé mi teléfono en casa!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（............）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（............）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......While I'm here......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Ya que estoy aquí......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Forget about the memories and the＿mold. I wish to find Taiga! I beg of you!＿I'll put in another ¥100! Understand?!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Olvídate de los recuerdos y el moho.＿¡Deseo encontrar a Taiga! ¡Te lo ruego!＿¡Pondré otros ¥100! ¡¿Entendido?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Alright.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「TAIGAAA! WHERE ARE YOUUU?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡TAIGAAA! ¿DÓNDE ESTÁAAAS?」"

msgid "Taiga「RYUUUJIIII!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡RYUUUJIIII!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I was looking for you!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oh, te estaba buscando!」"

msgid "Taiga「That's my line! Why didn't you answer＿your phone?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Esa es mi frase! ¡¿Por qué no＿contestaste el teléfono?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, I don't have it on me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, no lo traigo encima.」"

msgid "Taiga「I looked everywhere!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Busqué por todas partes!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Same here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo también.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm tired.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estoy cansada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo también.」"

msgid "Taiga「My feet hurt. I can't walk.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me duelen los pies. No puedo caminar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. Let's take a break.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien. Descansemos un poco.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Good grief...... Guess I'll try to make it＿up to her......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Qué remedio...... Supongo que intentaré＿compensárselo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Err...... I still wish for the memories＿thing, but if possible I also wish for＿mold to stop growing in the bathroom.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ehm...... Aún deseo lo de mis＿recuerdos, pero si es posible también＿que deje de salir moho en el baño.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's worth another ¥5...... And also,＿uh......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eso vale otros ¥5......＿Y además, ehm......）」"
